Package: flowUtilities
Title: Utility Functions for Flow Cytometry Analysis Using flowWorkspace
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("John", "Edgar", email="edgarjohnmichael@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions for working with GatingSets but with some compatiblity
  with flowSets and cytosets. Includes functions to extract and add metadata from .fcs filenames,
  apply compensation, construct gates, and build plots. Designed to minimize time spent writing code.
